{"query_id":"A.general.minor_purchase","module":"A","domain":"总则","query_text":"我家孩子十一岁，瞒着家长花八千元买了游戏设备，我们发现后明确不同意这笔交易，商家说孩子已经付款就不能退，怎么办？","qrels":{"rule.act.limited_capacity.v1":3,"rule.act.void_or_revoked.effect.v1":2},"judgment_basis":"curated_silver_non_exhaustive: 重点判断超出年龄相适应范围的交易是否经同意或追认，以及不生效后的返还；不是把未成年人一切购买都认定无效。","source_refs":["https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/233181.html","rule:rule.act.limited_capacity.v1","provision:law.prc.civil_code.2021.article_0145","span:span.civil-code.145.good-faith-revoke","span:span.civil-code.145.pure-or-suited","span:span.civil-code.145.urge-ratify","rule:rule.act.void_or_revoked.effect.v1","provision:law.prc.civil_code.2021.article_0155","provision:law.prc.civil_code.2021.article_0156","provision:law.prc.civil_code.2021.article_0157","span:span.civil-code.155.void-ab-initio","span:span.civil-code.156.severance","span:span.civil-code.157.restitution"],"exclude_ids":[]}
