{"query_id":"A.tort.product","module":"A","domain":"侵权责任","query_text":"新买的电热水壶因内部设计缺陷炸裂，把我烫伤，商店让我只找厂家，厂家又让我只找商店。我可以向谁要求赔偿？","qrels":{"rule.tort.product.producer_defect.v1":3,"rule.tort.product.claim_producer_or_seller.v1":3,"rule.tort.product.internal_recourse.v1":2},"judgment_basis":"curated_silver_non_exhaustive: 缺陷致损和被侵权人可选择责任主体为核心；生产者与销售者内部追偿不应变成拒绝对外处理的理由。","source_refs":["https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/233181.html","rule:rule.tort.product.producer_defect.v1","provision:law.prc.civil_code.2021.article_1202","provision:law.prc.civil_code.2021.article_1165","span:span.civil-code.1165.fault-liability","span:span.civil-code.1202.producer","rule:rule.tort.product.claim_producer_or_seller.v1","provision:law.prc.civil_code.2021.article_1203","span:span.civil-code.1203.claim-choice","rule:rule.tort.product.internal_recourse.v1","span:span.civil-code.1203.producer-recourse","span:span.civil-code.1203.seller-recourse"],"exclude_ids":[]}
